---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Servers"
description: "Join the Tactical Counter-Strike 2 KZ server."
permalink: /servers/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<h1>Servers</h1>

{% for srv in servers %}
<div class="panel">
  <h2>{{ srv.name }}</h2>
  <p><strong>Game:</strong> {{ srv.game }} · <strong>Mode:</strong> {{ srv.mode }}</p>

  <pre class="language-text"><code class="language-text">connect {{ srv.address }}</code></pre>

  <div class="action-bar">
    <a href="steam://connect/{{ srv.address }}" class="btn">Connect via Steam</a>
    <a href="{{ srv.webUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">Server web page</a>
  </div>

  <ul>
    {% for feat in srv.features %}
      <li>{{ feat }}</li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 0;">
    Server browser tags:
    {% for t in srv.tags %}
      <code>{{ t }}</code>{% if not loop.last %} {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </p>
</div>
{% endfor %}

<h2>Admins</h2>
<p>If you run into server issues or want to suggest a map, get in touch via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> or reach us on Steam:</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://steamcommunity.com/id/spawnterror" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tactical on Steam</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://steamcommunity.com/id/KZMOD/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HyperionTitan on Steam</a></li>
</ul>
